Vectezium is a modified version of Vector (https://github.com/vectordotdev/vector), forked from
Vector v0.60.0 (commit 0d0b35865036f8b5c2f0104d9744fa84985ffff1). The `vectezium` branch adds a
shared change-data-capture core, the mysql_cdc and postgres_cdc sources, and two azure_blob sink
options; `git log 0d0b358..vectezium` lists every change.

